ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 19784, Oct. 31, 2023>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force 1 year after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Applicability to formulation of comprehensive quantum plans)
The comprehensive quantum plan and the quantum cluster master plan shall be formulated starting from the year following the year in which the enforcement date of this Act falls.
Article 3 (General transitional measures concerning disposition)
Dispositions, procedures, and other activities under the previous Special Act on Information and Communications Promotion and Convergence Activation as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed dispositions, procedures, and other activities under this Act if provisions corresponding thereto exist in this Act.
Article 4 (Transitional measures concerning designation of dedicated institutions)
(1) The Korea Institute of Science and Technology and the Electronics and Telecommunications Research Institute under the Act on the Establishment, Operation and Fostering of Government-Funded Science and Technology Research Institutes designated as a dedicated institution under Article 27-2(3) of the previous Special Act on Information and Communications Promotion and Convergence Activation as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed designated as quantum research centers under Article 18(1).
(2) The National Information Society Promotion Agency established under Article 12 of the Framework Act on Intelligent Informatization, which was designated as a dedicated institution under Article 27-2(3) of the previous Special Act on Information and Communications Promotion and Convergence Activation as at the time this Act enters into force, shall be deemed designated as a dedicated institution under Articles 14(2) and 16(2), respectively.
Article 5 (Transitional measures concerning designation of quantum clusters)
The quantum industry clusters designated by the Minister of Science and ICT under Article 27-4 of the previous Special Act on Information and Communications Promotion and Convergence Activation as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed quantum clusters under this Act.
